<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Thinking Talking on KuthorX Blog II</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/</link><description>Recent content in Thinking Talking on KuthorX Blog II</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Introduction to *The Last Case*</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/the-last-case/</link><pubDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/the-last-case/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="story-synopsis">Story Synopsis&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>The great detective of old, 

&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/posts/fiction/sad-slow-song/">Polson Wall&lt;/a>
, entrusted his life to 

&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/story_of_cloak/characters/d-xxxx/">Dead Elephant&lt;/a>
 through his final moments, passing it to 

&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/story_of_cloak/characters/k-1647/">K-1647&lt;/a>
.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>K-1647’s consciousness continually fused with Wall’s, splitting into 

&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/story_of_cloak/characters/k-1647/">Cloak&lt;/a>
, 

&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/story_of_cloak/characters/s-6458">Fireclaw&lt;/a>
, and 

&lt;a href="https://kuthorx.github.io/story_of_cloak/characters/a-4597">Earfish&lt;/a>
, then projecting them through the &lt;em>&lt;strong>projector&lt;/strong>&lt;/em> onto different &lt;em>&lt;strong>planes&lt;/strong>&lt;/em>.&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>Plane 0 &lt;em>Story of Cloak&lt;/em> (storyline 0x00–0x0F)&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Where the three characters first meet.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>Plane A &lt;em>The Greenish Eye&lt;/em> (storyline 0xA0–0xAF)&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>A chaotic timeline filled with puzzles.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Most tricks concern sound and colour; players solve them by mapping spectrograms and optical spectra.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Eleven cases are planned.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;/li>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>Plane B &lt;em>Katelyn Wall’s Last Case&lt;/em> (storyline 0xB0–0xBF)&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Editor’s Note: The Greenish Eye</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/thats-it/</link><pubDate>Tue, 05 Aug 2025 20:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/thats-it/</guid><description>The show must go on</description></item><item><title>Another Boundary 1 / 2</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/after-read-deconstruction/</link><pubDate>Thu, 13 Jun 2024 02:15:02 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/after-read-deconstruction/</guid><description>Deconstruction</description></item><item><title>Starting with *Johnny Keep Walking*</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/talk-from-johnny-keep-walking/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/talk-from-johnny-keep-walking/</guid><description>The show must go on</description></item><item><title>“I” Came Back, but “I” Will Soon Set Out Again</title><link>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/i-come-back-i-will-start-soon/</link><pubDate>Sat, 10 Dec 2022 23:59:59 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://kuthorx.github.io/en/posts/thinking-talking/i-come-back-i-will-start-soon/</guid><description>Once Again</description></item></channel></rss>